  "code": "/*\n * DMM Current Measurement\n * The DMM is placed in series to measure current through an LED.\n * Circuit: 5V → R1 → DMM → LED → GND\n */\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  Serial.println(\"DMM Current Demo\");\n  Serial.println(\"Current = V / R\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  delay(1000);\n}"
}